  "vc_staticCDC、DFT 分析 · 另用 JasperGold 形式驗證、Design Compiler 合成": "<span class=\"tag o\">vc_static</span>CDC and DFT analysis · plus JasperGold formal verification and Design Compiler synthesis",
  "前端先講 TSMC 實習。2024 暑假參加 DTP，負責優化 N7 ADPLL 的數位電路。": "For front-end, first my <strong>TSMC internship</strong>. In summer 2024 I joined the DTP program and was responsible for optimizing <strong>the N7 ADPLL digital logic</strong>.",
  "做法是運算單元共用：原本三組運算各有一顆乘法器，算完才用 MUX 選其中一個結果，但同一時間只會用到一組。所以我把 MUX 移到乘法器前面，先選運算元、再乘，三組共用一顆乘法器；位寬不同的運算元先做 bit extension 對齊。": "The approach was <strong>resource sharing</strong>. Originally three operations each had their own multiplier, and a MUX picked one result afterwards, even though only one operation is active at a time. So I moved the MUX in front of the multiplier, <strong>selecting the operands first and then multiplying</strong>, so all three share one multiplier; operands of different widths are bit-extended to line up.",
  "結果是 ADPLL 數位區塊功耗降 16%、面積降 21%，優化後續也被設計採用。": "The result: the ADPLL digital block's <strong>power dropped 16% and its area 21%</strong>, and the optimization was later adopted in the design.",
  "另外用 Verdi 把內部狀態機可視化來追行為，用 VC_STATIC 做 CDC、DFT 分析，也用 JasperGold 做形式驗證。": "I also used Verdi to visualize the internal state machines and trace their behavior, VC_STATIC for CDC and DFT analysis, and JasperGold for formal verification.",
  // ---- 08 Sphere decoder
  "R：先載入 4 拍": "R: 4 cycles",
