  "8 種候選": "8 candidates",
  "R · ŝ（已選）": "R · ŝ (chosen)",
  "×s：±1、±j 只是正負號 / 實虛部交換": "×s: ±1, ±j are just sign flips / Re–Im swaps",
  "×0.75 = (x>>1)+(x>>2) 代替 0.707；8 個乘積每層只算一次再共用": "×0.75 = (x>>1)+(x>>2) stands in for 0.707; 8 products shared per layer",
  "→ PDE 不用乘法器；|Re|+|Im| 取代平方": "→ no multiplier in the PDE; |Re|+|Im| replaces squaring",
  "SORT 網路 · 32 → 4": "SORT NETWORK · 32 → 4",
  "4 條": "×4",
  "比 12-bit PDE，整筆 24-bit 紀錄一起換 · 第 4 層取最小 = find min": "compare 12-bit PDE, swap 24-bit record · layer 4 min = find min",
  "8 級 pipeline": "8-stage pipeline",
  "N16 標準元件 · DC 合成": "N16 standard cells · DC synthesis",
  "R 載入後連續輸入": "streaming input after R loads",
  "對 MATLAB 定點 golden 全部一致": "all match the MATLAB fixed-point golden",
  "第二個是 4×4 MIMO 的 K-best sphere decoder，8-PSK、K = 4。上面是整體架構：先用 4 拍載入 QR 分解後的 R，之後 每拍進一筆 ŷ；四層各有 PDE 跟 SORT，每層兩級 pipeline、共 8 級，ŷ 每層延遲兩拍對齊。": "The second is a <strong>4×4 MIMO K-best sphere decoder</strong>, 8-PSK with K = 4. The top shows the overall architecture: R from the QR decomposition is loaded in 4 cycles, then <strong>one ŷ enters every cycle</strong>. Each of the four layers has a PDE and a SORT stage, <strong>two pipeline stages per layer, eight in total</strong>, and ŷ is delayed two cycles per layer to stay aligned.",
  "左下是 PDE 的電路：每條候選算 ŷ 減掉 R 乘符號，取 |Re|+|Im| 當距離，再加上一層留下來的 PDE。乘符號的部分沒有用乘法器：8-PSK 的 ±1、±j 只是正負號或實虛部交換，對角點用 0.75 = 兩個移位相加代替 0.707（golden 的星座點也用 0.75）；8 個乘積每層只算一次，再用 path 的 3-bit symbol index 透過 8 選 1 MUX 分給各條候選。": "Bottom left is the PDE circuit: each candidate computes ŷ minus R times the symbol, takes <strong>|Re|+|Im|</strong> as the distance, and adds the PDE carried from the layer above. The symbol multiply <strong>uses no multiplier</strong>: for 8-PSK, ±1 and ±j are just sign flips or real–imaginary swaps, and the diagonal points use 0.75 = two shifts added, in place of 0.707 (the golden model uses 0.75 as well). The 8 products are computed once per layer and routed to each candidate through an 8-to-1 MUX driven by the path's 3-bit symbol index.",
  "右下是排序網路：32 筆分 4 組做 MERGE8，再兩兩 MERGE16 各留 4 筆，最後 8 取 4；比的是 12-bit 的 PDE，整筆 24-bit 紀錄一起交換。第 4 層取最小的那條，path 轉回符號輸出。": "Bottom right is the sorting network: the 32 entries go through MERGE8 in 4 groups, then pairwise MERGE16 keeping 4 each, and finally 8-to-4. It compares the 12-bit PDE and swaps the whole 24-bit record. Layer 4 takes the minimum, and its path is converted back into output symbols.",
  "（被問到是不是完整排序時）最小值一定正確，所以最後的最佳路徑沒問題；第 1 層因為 8-PSK 的距離照角度排是 bitonic，8 取 4 也是準的（8 個數字所有繞圈單峰的排列 512 種全試過）。但第 2、3 層留下的 4 條不保證是真正的前 4 名，這套網路比完整排序少了幾級比較，等於近似、K 打了折；golden 用的是同一套網路，所以 bit-exact 一致。": "(If asked whether it's a full sort) The minimum is always correct, so the final best path is right. In layer 1 the 8-PSK distances are bitonic in angle, so 8-to-4 is exact there too. But the 4 kept in layers 2 and 3 are not guaranteed to be the true top 4: the network skips a few compare stages of a full sort, so it is an approximation. The golden model uses the same network, so the two match bit-exactly (layer 1 checked on all 512 cyclic-unimodal orderings of 8 numbers; in later layers K is effectively reduced).",
  "合成用 N16 標準元件：cycle time 0.71 ns、面積約 42,337 µm²；VCS 跟 MATLAB 定點 golden 比對，1,056 bits 全部一致。": "Synthesized with <strong>N16 standard cells</strong>: 0.71 ns cycle time and about 42,337 µm². In VCS against the MATLAB fixed-point golden, all 1,056 bits match.",
  // ---- 09 CNN accelerator
  "3 / 3Front-end · Quantized CNN · 手勢辨識 20 類": "<span class=\"pn\">3 / 3</span>Front-end · Quantized CNN · 20-class Hand Gestures",
  "QAT INT8 CNN：從量化訓練到 APR": "QAT INT8 CNN: From Quantized Training to APR",
  "PyTorch QAT 帶著 fake-quant 訓練，convert() 轉成 INT8，再把 bias 與 scale 換成整數參數給 RTL": "QAT trains with fake-quant, convert() makes it INT8, then bias and scales become integer parameters for the RTL",
  "帶到團隊波形也可以做成 Claude Code 看得懂的工具，幫忙 debug": "<b>For your team</b>waveforms can also become a tool Claude Code understands, to help debug",
  "CONV 1 · 4 個 PE": "CONV 1 · 4 PEs",
  "CONV 2 · 6 ch 時間多工": "CONV 2 · 6 ch, time-mux",
