  "每拍進 1 像素 → 出 1 個 3×3 視窗": "per cycle: 1 pixel in → one 3×3 window out",
  "輸入影像 10 × 10": "input image 10 × 10",
  "tap = 目前這一欄 x：讀出兩列、再往上寫回": "tap = column x: read 2 rows, write back",
