  "9 個值 → PE": "9 values → PE",
  "兩條 line buffer 依欄定址存前兩列，每列再接 3 級 shift；新像素從右邊進來": "line buffers hold the last 2 rows · 3-stage shift per row · new pixel enters on the right",
  "INT8 權重 × UINT8 → INT32": "INT8 weights × UINT8 → INT32",
  "REQUANT · 7 級 pipeline": "REQUANT · 7-stage pipeline",
  "低": "lo",
  "高": "hi",
  "合併": "merge",
  "捨入": "round",
  "M：每通道 Q31 乘數 · acc 先截掉低 8 bit": "M: per-channel Q31 multiplier · acc drops low 8 bits",
  "conv1：4 PE × 9 = 36 · conv2：36（6 ch 時間多工）· FC：12": "conv1: 4 PE × 9 = 36 · conv2: 36 (6 ch time-multiplexed) · FC: 12",
  "→ 共 84 個 MAC 乘法器；requant 另有 7 組、每組 2 個乘法": "→ 84 MAC multipliers in total; requant adds 7 units of 2 multiplies each",
  "TSMC 0.13 µm · 10 ns 目標": "TSMC 0.13 µm · 10 ns target",
  "post-route · 0 / 13,741 違規 · Innovus": "post-route · 0 / 13,741 violations · Innovus",
  "DC 合成 · 53,524 cells": "DC synthesis · 53,524 cells",
  "P 暫停 · , . 逐拍 · 點圖也可暫停": "P pause · , . step · click the diagram to pause",
  "第三個是 QAT 量化的 INT8 CNN，做手勢辨識、20 類。": "The third is a <strong>QAT-quantized INT8 CNN</strong> for hand-gesture recognition with 20 classes.",
  "精度是分三步轉的：先在 FP32 模型插 fake-quant 做 QAT，用 fbgemm 的設定訓練 20 個 epoch；再用 convert() 轉成真正的 INT8 模型，權重 INT8、per-channel，activation UINT8；最後匯出給 RTL：bias 換算成 INT32，每通道的 scale 換成 Q31 乘數加 shift。": "Precision is converted in three steps. First, <strong>fake-quant</strong> is inserted into the FP32 model for QAT, trained for 20 epochs with the fbgemm config. Then <strong>convert()</strong> turns it into a real INT8 model: INT8 per-channel weights and UINT8 activations. Finally it is exported for the RTL: biases become INT32, and each channel's scale becomes a <strong>Q31 multiplier plus a shift</strong>.",
  "硬體上 MAC 累加是 INT32，每一層輸出都要 requant：acc 乘上每通道的 Q31 乘數再右移、加 zero point、clamp 到 0–255。這個乘法很寬，我把它拆成 7 級 pipeline：乘法拆兩段、再合併、64-bit 捨入加法分兩拍、移位，最後加 zp 並 clamp。": "In hardware the MAC accumulates in INT32, and every layer's output is requantized: the accumulator is multiplied by the per-channel Q31 multiplier, shifted right, offset by the zero point and clamped to 0–255. That multiply is wide, so I split it into a <strong>7-stage pipeline</strong>: the multiply in two halves, a merge, the 64-bit rounding add over two cycles, the shift, and finally the zero point and clamp.",
  "資料流一拍進一個像素：兩條 line buffer 依欄定址存前兩列，每列再接 3 級 shift 組出 3×3 視窗，新像素從右邊進來。conv1 是 4 個 PE、conv2 用時間多工跑 6 個通道，總共 84 個 MAC 乘法器，requant 另外 7 組。": "Data streams in one pixel per cycle: two column-addressed line buffers hold the previous two rows, and each row feeds a 3-stage shift that forms the 3×3 window, with new pixels entering on the right. conv1 has 4 PEs and conv2 time-multiplexes 6 channels, <strong>84 MAC multipliers</strong> in total, plus 7 requant units.",
  "實作：DC 合成在 TSMC 0.13、100 MHz，面積約 88 萬 µm²；Innovus APR 完 post-route setup WNS +1.30 ns、setup 沒有違規；hold 還有 2 條、差不到 0.001 ns，另有少量 max cap / tran / fanout 要收。": "Implementation: DC synthesis in TSMC 0.13 at 100 MHz, about 880k µm². After Innovus APR, post-route setup WNS is +1.30 ns with no setup violations; 2 hold paths remain, off by less than 0.001 ns, plus a few max cap / tran / fanout items to close.",
  "這部分可以延伸到團隊：波形也可以做成 Claude Code 看得懂的工具，幫忙 debug；這個我還沒做過，但做法跟接 PT、VC 一樣。": "This extends to the team: <strong>waveforms can also become a tool Claude Code understands</strong>, to help debug; I haven't built that yet, but it works the same way as connecting PT and VC.",
  "（被問到準確率）50×50 版 INT8 98.38%、10×10 完整版 97.75%；合成的是 10×10 縮小版（4/6/6 通道），那版的準確率沒有留紀錄；選 epoch 用的也是 test set，數字偏樂觀。": "(If asked about accuracy) The 50×50 INT8 version reaches 98.38% and the full 10×10 version 97.75%. What I synthesized is a reduced 10×10 version (4/6/6 channels), and its accuracy was not recorded. The epoch was also picked on the test set, so these numbers are optimistic.",
  "（被問到驗證）golden 從 PyTorch INT8 模型逐層抓，testbench 逐拍比 20 個輸出；最後一次留下紀錄的比對（4 月）還差 1–2 LSB，原因是 golden 跟匯出的參數來自不同 checkpoint、加上累加器先截 8 bit；之後 RTL 跟 golden 都改過，目前狀態要重跑確認。": "(If asked about verification) The golden data is captured layer by layer from the PyTorch INT8 model, and the testbench compares the 20 outputs cycle by cycle. The last recorded comparison (April) was still off by 1–2 LSB, because the golden and the exported parameters came from different checkpoints, and the accumulator drops 8 bits first. Both the RTL and the golden have changed since, so the current state needs a rerun to confirm.",
  "（動畫：P 暫停、逗號／句號逐拍）": "(Animation: P pauses; comma / period step one cycle.)",
