  "硬體的部分：QR 分解是 CVSD 的期末專案，CORDIC 做 QR，從 RTL、DC 合成一路走到 Innovus APR，這張是 layout。RTL 旁通道評估是碩士研究，用 VCS 模擬產生 SAIF、算 toggle 的 KL divergence，評估 20 種加密電路、用階層樹定位危險模組。Style Filter 是高階 SoC 設計的團隊專案，用 Catapult HLS 做濾鏡 IP，整合進 SoC 跑 FPGA。CIC 2025 進了決賽，題目是凸包的硬體。": "Hardware: <strong>QR decomposition</strong> was my CVSD final project, QR with CORDIC taken from RTL through DC synthesis to Innovus APR; this is the layout. <strong>RTL side-channel assessment</strong> is from my master's research: VCS simulation produces SAIF, I compute the KL divergence of toggles, assess 20 crypto circuits, and use a hierarchy tree to locate risky modules. <strong>Style Filter</strong> was a team project in Advanced SoC Design: a filter IP built with Catapult HLS, integrated into an SoC and run on FPGA. In <strong>CIC 2025</strong> I reached the final, with convex hull hardware as the task.",
  "軟體的部分：網站前後端、爬蟲、遊戲、量化回測都自己寫過，在 NVIDIA 能自己把平台做起來也是靠這些。": "Software: I've written web front and back ends, crawlers, a game and quant backtests myself, and that's what let me build the platform at NVIDIA on my own.",
