  "這套是用自己的錢在實盤跑的。": "This system trades <strong>live</strong> with my own money.",
  "上面是實盤流程，每個交易日美東 10:05 由 systemd 自動跑：抓資料、算 12-1 動能取前 10 檔，中間有三道閘門：新聞否決、下單前檢查、最後對帳。任何一關不過就 fail-closed，不下單或直接中止；抓不到新聞也算不過。": "The top is the live pipeline, run by systemd at 10:05 ET every trading day: fetch data, compute 12-1 momentum and take the top 10, with <strong>three gates</strong> along the way: a news veto, a pre-trade check and a final reconciliation. If any gate fails, it <strong>fails closed</strong>: no orders, or an outright abort. Missing news counts as a failure too.",
  "離目標 ±20% 以內不動，這個帶寬在回測裡把手續費降了 81%。訂單是六狀態的狀態機，cid 用 hash 產生，重送也不會重複下單。": "Positions within ±20% of target are left alone; in backtests that band cut fees by 81%. Orders go through a six-state machine, and the cid is a hash, so a resend never places a duplicate order.",
  "下面三個是共用模組：Rust 的部位計算核心，研究跟實盤共用同一份；斷路器 −35% 停買、−40% 出清；看門狗只讀不寫，有異常就發 Telegram。也做過一次 fail-closed 稽核，補上 3 個 critical、4 個 high 的漏洞。": "Below are three shared modules: a Rust position-sizing core, the same copy used by research and live; a breaker that stops buying at −35% and liquidates at −40%; and a read-only watchdog that sends Telegram alerts on anomalies. I also ran a fail-closed audit and fixed 3 critical and 4 high findings.",
  "研究端是我用 Rust 寫的因子引擎，一條公式從 10 秒變 63 毫秒；用 golden 案例驗證，故意注入 41 個 bug 抓到 38 個。": "On the research side is a factor engine I wrote in Rust: one formula went from 10 seconds to 63 milliseconds. It's verified with golden cases; of 41 deliberately injected bugs, it caught 38.",
  "結果我照實說：右下這張是用現在的規則、含已下市股票的資料，回測 2010 到 2026 年。長期年化 18.6%，QQQ 是 19.7%，差不多；但最大回撤 −45%，比 QQQ 的 −35% 深，而且輸贏是一段一段的：2016 到 21 年每年落後 20 點，2022 年之後每年領先 22 點。這張回測的參數用過這段資料，不算樣本外；更早的 v3 參數只用 2022 年之後的資料挑，拿 2016 到 21 年當樣本外驗證，也是年化 8.6% 對 QQQ 25%。因子搜尋試了 696 條公式，也沒有一條過多重檢定門檻，所以我不宣稱有 alpha，也就是不宣稱有超額報酬。這套系統練的是驗證跟 fail-closed 的習慣，跟做晶片驗證的思路一樣。": "Now the honest result. The chart at bottom right backtests the current rules from 2010 to 2026 on data that includes delisted stocks. The long-run CAGR is 18.6% against QQQ's 19.7%, roughly even, but the maximum drawdown is −45%, deeper than QQQ's −35%, and the wins and losses come in stretches: about 20 points a year behind from 2016 to 2021, and about 22 points a year ahead since 2022. These parameters have already seen this data, so it is not out of sample. The earlier v3 parameters were picked only on data from 2022 on and validated out of sample on 2016–2021, where they returned 8.6% a year against QQQ's 25%. The factor search tried 696 formulas and none passed the multiple-testing bar, so <strong>I don't claim any alpha</strong>, meaning no excess return. What this system trained is verification and fail-closed habits, the same mindset as chip verification.",
  "接著快速補充修課跟獲獎。": "Next, a quick look at coursework and awards.",
