  "獲獎跟發表：今年有兩篇論文，一篇是 NVIDIA NTECH China 2026 的共同發表，一篇是 GrAPL @ IPDPS 2026 的 CHROMA；2025 年 CIC 競賽進決賽；碩士拿台大精英碩士獎學金，大學是中興電機優秀畢業生、系排第一，菁英獎跟兩次書卷獎。": "Awards and publications: two papers this year, a co-authored one at <strong>NVIDIA NTECH China 2026</strong> and CHROMA at <strong>GrAPL @ IPDPS 2026</strong>. In 2025 I <strong>reached the final of the CIC contest</strong>. For my master's I received the NTU Elite Master's Scholarship; in undergrad I was an Outstanding Graduate of NCHU EE, ranked first in my class, with an Elite Award and two Academic Excellence Awards.",
  "修課跟這個職缺最相關的是積體電路系統測試、系統晶片驗證，加上高階系統晶片設計、DSP 架構設計、通信數位 IC 設計；也上過 DC 合成、ICC2 實體設計、Full-Custom 的訓練課程。": "The courses most relevant to this role are <strong>VLSI Testing and SoC Verification</strong>, plus Advanced SoC Design, DSP Architecture Design and Digital IC Design for Communications. I also took training courses on DC synthesis, ICC2 physical design and full-custom design.",
