  "兩個練習：Async FIFO 與 DRAM command scheduler": "Two exercises: async FIFO and DRAM scheduler",
  "對著 ASIC team 的工作內容自己做的：CDC，和 memory controller 的排程核心。RTL、SVA、cocotb、DC、PT 走完一輪，每個模組都能自己畫出來講": "Built against what this ASIC team does: CDC, and the scheduling core of a memory controller. RTL, SVA, cocotb, DC and PT end to end; I can draw and explain every module",
