  "閒時機會式還、忙時 PRE-ALL → REF → tRFC": "paid opportunistically when idle; PRE-ALL → REF → tRFC when busy",
  "補齊的": "added since",
  "讀優先與 write drain；CKE 進 power-down / self-refresh；可程式時序與效能計數器；DDR4 bank group；(72,64) SECDED；UVM 加覆蓋率；clock gating 與 UPF；兩個 AXI port 拆 burst、ROB、HPR/LPR 仲裁、位址對應；DFI 1:2 PHY-lite、上電初始化、write leveling、read gate training；GLS、Formality": "read-first with write drain; CKE power-down / self-refresh; programmable timings and perf counters; DDR4 bank groups; (72,64) SECDED; UVM with coverage; clock gating and UPF; two AXI ports with burst splitting, a ROB, HPR/LPR arbitration and address mapping; a DFI 1:2 PHY-lite with power-up init, write leveling and read gate training; GLS and Formality",
  "這一頁是我知道要面這個 team 之後，這兩週自己做的兩個練習，針對 JD 上的 CDC 和 memory controller。": "This slide is two exercises I built in the two weeks after I knew I would meet this team, aimed at the CDC and memory-controller items in the job description.",
  "Async FIFO：Cummings FIFO1 的結構，Gray 指標過兩級同步器。重點不在寫出來，而是驗證和約束：SVA 在 testbench 裡同時看兩邊的二進位指標，證明 full 和 empty 只會保守不會錯；DC 跑了兩套 SDC，一套 clock groups、一套 -allow_paths 加 max_delay 壓 Gray 匯流排，PT 最後故意把 clock groups 拿掉，看到 STA 拿兩個週期的公因數 0.1 ns 當要求。另外做了 jitter 注入：同步器第一級隨機晚一拍，Gray 版全過，二進位指標的對照版同步後會出現從未存在的值。": "<strong>Async FIFO</strong>: Cummings' FIFO1 structure, Gray pointers through two-flop synchronizers. The point was not writing it but verifying and constraining it: SVA in the testbench sees both binary pointers at once and proves full and empty are only ever conservative; DC ran two SDC strategies, plain clock groups and -allow_paths plus max_delay on the Gray buses, and PT finally removed the clock groups on purpose to show STA demanding the 0.1 ns common factor of the two periods. I also built jitter injection: the first synchronizer flop randomly samples one cycle late; the Gray version passes everything, the binary-pointer counter-example shows pointer values that never existed.",
  "DRAM scheduler：controller 三層裡的中間那層。8 個 bank 各自的狀態機和計數器、rank 層的 tRRD、tFAW、tCCD、tWTR、tRFC，排程是 open-page 加 FR-FCFS，refresh 欠到 8 次才強制，輸出是 DFI 風格的命令腳位。驗證是 Python 寫的 PHY 加 DRAM 模型，隨機讀寫兩千九百筆全對；每條 JEDEC 時序各一條 assertion，把 tRCD 偷改短兩拍馬上被抓到。SMIC 0.13 合成 200 MHz 剛好過，關鍵路徑在排程器的優先順序鏈。": "<strong>DRAM scheduler</strong>: the middle of the controller's three layers. A state machine and counters per bank, rank-level tRRD, tFAW, tCCD, tWTR and tRFC, open-page FR-FCFS scheduling, refresh forced only after eight are owed, DFI-style command pins out. Verification is a Python PHY plus DRAM model, 2,900 random accesses all correct; one assertion per JEDEC timing, and shortening tRCD by two cycles is caught at once. SMIC 0.13 synthesis just meets 200 MHz, critical path in the scheduler's priority chain.",
  "後來又補了：讀寫優先權加 write drain 加年齡上限、CKE 的 power-down 和 self-refresh、APB 可程式時序和效能計數器、DDR4 bank group 的 L/S 時序、(72,64) SECDED ECC、一個最小的 UVM 環境加 covergroup、DC 自動 clock gating 加 UPF 把排程核心做成 self-refresh 時可以斷電的電源域，GLS 和 Formality 確認 netlist。最後把另外兩層也做了：前端兩個 AXI port 拆 burst、ROB、HPR/LPR 仲裁加限流、RBC/BRC/XOR 位址對應；後端 DFI 1:2、PHY 的數位部分、上電初始化、MRS、ZQ、write leveling、read gate training、DFI sideband，測試台到 pin-level 的 DDR3 模型，三個時脈用 generated clock 合成。沒做的我也清楚：PHY 的類比部分、DFI 1:4、per-bank refresh、DFT。被問到可以講加在哪裡。": "More followed: read priority with write drain and aging, CKE power-down and self-refresh, APB-programmable timings and perf counters, DDR4 bank-group L/S timing, (72,64) SECDED ECC, a minimal UVM environment with a covergroup, DC clock gating plus a UPF power domain that switches the scheduler core off in self-refresh, and GLS and Formality on the netlist. Then the other two layers: a front-end with two AXI ports (burst splitting, a ROB, HPR/LPR arbitration with throttling, RBC/BRC/XOR address mapping) and a back-end with DFI 1:2, the digital part of the PHY, power-up initialisation, MRS, ZQ, write leveling, read gate training and the DFI sideband, tested against a pin-level DDR3 model and synthesised with three clocks and a generated clock. I also know what is missing: the analog PHY, DFI 1:4, per-bank refresh, DFT. I can say where each would go.",
  "Async FIFO 同步器鏈": "Async FIFO synchronizer chain",
